[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    108[0m:[38;5;10m[49m | stdout and stderr merged (`2>&1`) | identical combined stream, `Hello World!\n`; pins down that stderr receives nothing and write ordering matches |
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    109[0m:[38;5;10m[49m | empty environment (`env_clear`) | identical; no `getenv` in the C |
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    110[0m:[38;5;10m[49m | `LC_ALL`/`LANG` set to `C`, `POSIX`, `en_US.UTF-8`, `de_DE.UTF-8`, `tr_TR.UTF-8`, and empty | identical; the format string has no conversion specifiers, so no locale-sensitive formatting exists |
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    111[0m:[38;5;10m[49m | 25 repeated runs | identical every time, and identical to each other — output is deterministic |
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    112[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    113[0m:[38;5;10m[49m ## Things deliberately not "fixed"
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    114[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
